  - {fileID: 8995154407686431259, guid: 3b12507c9f454ac40911aa5f7e98776a, type: 3}
  isEnemy: 0000000000000000
  dialogue:
  - "Departure confirmed. Current coordinates\u2026undefined (no data). Confirmed
    successful arrival."
  - "The landscape has changed drastically from where you were moments before. The
    clean and organized military base is gone, replaced by an urban wasteland. The
    sky is overcast\u2013 or is it rather filled with ash? "
  - "Maybe it\u2019s best to avoid such questions.  "
  - "There\u2019s no sign of life anywhere in your immediate vicinity. The wastes
    are lit by the dim light of the moon, struggling to break through whatever it
    is that fills the sky. The only noise you hear is the eerie whistle of the wind
    through nearby buildings.  "
  - "But now you realize that there is something else\u2013 distant clattering, and
    sounds like shuffling coming from somewhere as well. "
  - 'You know this place has inhabitants, but who, or what, are they? '
  - 'Your two squadmates are also taking in the surroundings. You see RN fiddling
    with the safety switch on his rifle, his head slowly turning to scan the ruinous
    waste. '
  - "HV seems less observant, and more like he\u2019s trying to comprehend what he\u2019s
    seeing. It\u2019s also possible he can\u2019t actually see most of it. The tiny
    viewports in his helmet certainly aren\u2019t helping. "
